":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_10","text":"You knew right away.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_11","text":"If you know me that well, that must mean you love me bunches and bunches!","jump":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_16"},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_12","text":"Mister, I'm disappointed!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_13","text":"You can't differentiate Sakura and me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_14","text":"... Is this Rosanna by any chance?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_15","text":"Bingo!","jump":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_16"},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_16","text":"Did you take each other's phones?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_17","text":"Correctamundo.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_18","text":"I was leaving Sakura's house in a hurry,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_19","text":"and I wasn't paying attention.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_20","text":"I wonder...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key"