queen_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_44","text":"Exactly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_45","text":"That's what I'm saying! Typically, I'm the one making a fool out of myself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_46","text":"You should change the way you speak, Rosanna.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_47","text":"The way Sakura speaks really matches your profile pic.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_48","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_49","text":"Moran.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_50","text":"Just shut up, okay?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_51","text":"We're talking here!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_52","text":"Don't say that with my phone.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_53","text":"LOL","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_02_54","text":"Ugh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen